{
  "lang": "zh",
  "availableLangs": [
    "zh",
    "en"
  ],
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "今天想和你聊一本书",
      "offset": 13966,
      "duration": 1934,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "或者说",
      "offset": 15900,
      "duration": 1166,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "想和你聊一个困扰了很多人的问题",
      "offset": 17166,
      "duration": 3200,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你有没有过这样的经历",
      "offset": 21433,
      "duration": 1700,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "看过秘密",
      "offset": 23466,
      "duration": 1300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "学过吸引力法则",
      "offset": 24833,
      "duration": 1667,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "每天对着宇宙下订单",
      "offset": 26800,
      "duration": 2166,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我想要更多的钱",
      "offset": 29433,
      "duration": 1833,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我想要更好的关系",
      "offset": 31466,
      "duration": 1934,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我想要更理想的生活",
      "offset": 33633,
      "duration": 2133,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你拼命的想",
      "offset": 35800,
      "duration": 1500,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "拼命的渴望",
      "offset": 37366,
      "duration": 1400,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "结果呢想要的钱没来",
      "offset": 38866,
      "duration": 2800,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "想要的人没到",
      "offset": 41666,
      "duration": 1600,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "反而自己越来越焦虑",
      "offset": 43366,
      "duration": 2000,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "甚至开始怀疑",
      "offset": 45700,
      "duration": 1433,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是不是我命不好",
      "offset": 47366,
      "duration": 1534,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是不是吸引力法则根本就是个骗局",
      "offset": 49033,
      "duration": 2867,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我以前也这样",
      "offset": 53033,
      "duration": 1300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "直到我遇到了这本书",
      "offset": 54800,
      "duration": 1966,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "卢奕琳老师的吸引自己的奇迹",
      "offset": 56766,
      "duration": 3167,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "录这本书的过程中",
      "offset": 60033,
      "duration": 1600,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我有一个特别深的感触",
      "offset": 61633,
      "duration": 2100,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "不是吸引力法则没用",
      "offset": 64000,
      "duration": 2066,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是我们绝大多数人都用错了",
      "offset": 66433,
      "duration": 2733,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "市面上讲吸引力法则的内容",
      "offset": 69266,
      "duration": 2700,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "大多就教你3件事要求",
      "offset": 72100,
      "duration": 3566,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "相信接收",
      "offset": 75800,
      "duration": 2200,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "说白了就是",
      "offset": 78000,
      "duration": 1700,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你使劲想",
      "offset": 80100,
      "duration": 1433,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "宇宙就会给",
      "offset": 81800,
      "duration": 1466,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "但你有没有发现",
      "offset": 83266,
      "duration": 1634,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "当你特别渴望一件事的时候",
      "offset": 85166,
      "duration": 2600,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这种渴望本身",
      "offset": 87800,
      "duration": 1800,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "其实带着一种很微妙的感觉",
      "offset": 89666,
      "duration": 2467,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "那是一种我没有的感觉",
      "offset": 92766,
      "duration": 2034,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你没有钱",
      "offset": 94800,
      "duration": 1200,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "所以你渴望钱你没有爱",
      "offset": 96000,
      "duration": 2866,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "所以你渴望爱",
      "offset": 98866,
      "duration": 1600,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "但这种我没有的频率",
      "offset": 100800,
      "duration": 1966,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "吸引来的",
      "offset": 102833,
      "duration": 1167,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "恰恰是更多没有的东西",
      "offset": 104166,
      "duration": 2200,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这就是为什么很多人越学",
      "offset": 106366,
      "duration": 1867,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "吸引力法则越焦虑",
      "offset": 108233,
      "duration": 1833,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "因为你的注意力全在缺上",
      "offset": 110666,
      "duration": 2534,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "而不是忧伤",
      "offset": 113400,
      "duration": 1466,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "而卢依琳老师的这本书",
      "offset": 114866,
      "duration": 2300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "最打动我的地方在于",
      "offset": 117433,
      "duration": 2100,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "他不止告诉你怎么做",
      "offset": 120033,
      "duration": 2067,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "更告诉你做错了怎么调",
      "offset": 122400,
      "duration": 2500,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "他不光讲吸引力法则怎么生效",
      "offset": 125000,
      "duration": 2866,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "更讲如果他失效了",
      "offset": 128033,
      "duration": 2633,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "原因在哪",
      "offset": 130666,
      "duration": 1234,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "怎么解决",
      "offset": 131900,
      "duration": 1200,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "今天",
      "offset": 133200,
      "duration": 966,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我就把这本书的核心精华讲给你听",
      "offset": 134466,
      "duration": 3734,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们先来说说",
      "offset": 138300,
      "duration": 1500,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这本书里最颠覆我认知的三个心法",
      "offset": 139800,
      "duration": 3400,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "第一个心法",
      "offset": 143266,
      "duration": 1300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "产生一种没有欲望的欲望",
      "offset": 145000,
      "duration": 2066,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "听起来像不像被论没有欲望的欲望",
      "offset": 147166,
      "duration": 3567,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这到底是什么",
      "offset": 150833,
      "duration": 1367,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "罗伊琳老师在书里解释说",
      "offset": 152300,
      "duration": 2500,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "当我们过度的把注意力放在想要",
      "offset": 155066,
      "duration": 2334,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "实现的东西上时",
      "offset": 157400,
      "duration": 1700,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们的内心就会变得紧绷",
      "offset": 159166,
      "duration": 2367,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这种紧绷背后",
      "offset": 161633,
      "duration": 1700,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "藏着的是小我的执着和匮乏感",
      "offset": 163433,
      "duration": 2867,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你太想考好这场事了",
      "offset": 166300,
      "duration": 2266,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "结果考试的时候焦虑紧张",
      "offset": 168700,
      "duration": 2366,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "手心出汗",
      "offset": 171200,
      "duration": 1100,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "大脑一片空白",
      "offset": 172500,
      "duration": 1633,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你太想得到这个人了",
      "offset": 174766,
      "duration": 1967,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "结果相处的时候患得患失",
      "offset": 176766,
      "duration": 2367,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "反而把对方越推越远",
      "offset": 179266,
      "duration": 2034,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "所以吸引力法则的关键",
      "offset": 181366,
      "duration": 2767,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "不在于强烈的欲望",
      "offset": 184366,
      "duration": 1934,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "而在于给自己定个目标",
      "offset": 186566,
      "duration": 2234,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "但别对这个目标抱有太多期待",
      "offset": 189433,
      "duration": 2767,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "越放松越容易得到",
      "offset": 192500,
      "duration": 2566,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "第二个心法",
      "offset": 195100,
      "duration": 1466,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你要先成为他",
      "offset": 196966,
      "duration": 1600,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "才能得到他",
      "offset": 198633,
      "duration": 1500,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这个我太有体会了",
      "offset": 200166,
      "duration": 1767,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "书里说如果你想成为有钱人",
      "offset": 202033,
      "duration": 3533,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "那就得先让自己",
      "offset": 205633,
      "duration": 1367,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "处于一个有钱人的状态",
      "offset": 207000,
      "duration": 1966,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "不是说要你先去挥霍",
      "offset": 209400,
      "duration": 1966,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "而是那种花钱时的轻松感佩感",
      "offset": 211566,
      "duration": 3434,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "那种对金钱的不焦虑",
      "offset": 215266,
      "duration": 2100,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "不匮乏",
      "offset": 217500,
      "duration": 1000,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "当你先让自己进入那种频率",
      "offset": 218633,
      "duration": 2367,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你才能真正吸引财富",
      "offset": 221166,
      "duration": 2167,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "就像你喜欢一个人",
      "offset": 223400,
      "duration": 1900,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你整天觉得自己配不上",
      "offset": 225400,
      "duration": 2300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "他怎么会喜欢我",
      "offset": 228266,
      "duration": 1534,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "那你传递出去的能量就是我不配",
      "offset": 230066,
      "duration": 3334,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "对方是能感受到的",
      "offset": 233700,
      "duration": 1966,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "但如果",
      "offset": 235666,
      "duration": 567,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你先让自己成为一个值得被爱的人",
      "offset": 236233,
      "duration": 3033,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "先好好爱自己",
      "offset": 239466,
      "duration": 2034,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "那种自信从容的气场",
      "offset": 241666,
      "duration": 2334,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "反而会吸引对方靠近",
      "offset": 244200,
      "duration": 2166,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "第三个心法",
      "offset": 246500,
      "duration": 1400,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "当你不想要他了",
      "offset": 248233,
      "duration": 1733,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你就能得到他",
      "offset": 250066,
      "duration": 1667,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这一点我认输的时候反复琢磨",
      "offset": 251766,
      "duration": 3034,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我以前特别想上稿",
      "offset": 255300,
      "duration": 1633,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "天天盯着邮箱",
      "offset": 257200,
      "duration": 1600,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "焦虑数据",
      "offset": 258800,
      "duration": 1300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "结果反而一直上不了",
      "offset": 260233,
      "duration": 1967,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "后来我慢慢想开了",
      "offset": 262233,
      "duration": 2033,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "专注于把自己想写的东西写好",
      "offset": 264400,
      "duration": 2700,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "不再纠结结果",
      "offset": 267100,
      "duration": 1666,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "反而意外获得了",
      "offset": 268900,
      "duration": 1166,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "上稿的机会卢依琳老师说",
      "offset": 270066,
      "duration": 3067,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "当你不再刻意去渴望某个东西时",
      "offset": 273366,
      "duration": 3000,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "那个东西就很容易自己找上门来",
      "offset": 276466,
      "duration": 2800,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "因为你的执着放下了",
      "offset": 279833,
      "duration": 2033,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你的匮乏感消失了",
      "offset": 281866,
      "duration": 2334,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你终于处在了拥有的频率里",
      "offset": 284200,
      "duration": 2533,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这三个心法是这本书的基石",
      "offset": 286800,
      "duration": 2866,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "只有掌握了他们",
      "offset": 290500,
      "duration": 1566,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你才能扫出心理障碍",
      "offset": 292200,
      "duration": 1900,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "后面用起吸引力法则来",
      "offset": 294666,
      "duration": 2567,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "才会得心应手",
      "offset": 297233,
      "duration": 1667,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "好新法有了",
      "offset": 299666,
      "duration": 2067,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "接下来就是实操",
      "offset": 301800,
      "duration": 1533,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "传统的吸引力法则",
      "offset": 303433,
      "duration": 1833,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "讲的是三步要求相信",
      "offset": 305266,
      "duration": 3234,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "接收",
      "offset": 308500,
      "duration": 1000,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "但这本书最厉害的地方",
      "offset": 310066,
      "duration": 2200,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是在这三步之外",
      "offset": 312266,
      "duration": 1834,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "加上了第四步",
      "offset": 314100,
      "duration": 1600,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "释放欲望带来的感受和欲望本身",
      "offset": 315966,
      "duration": 3000,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们来完整走一遍这四步",
      "offset": 319000,
      "duration": 2333,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "第一步要求",
      "offset": 321433,
      "duration": 2133,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "把你的命令发送出去",
      "offset": 323966,
      "duration": 2034,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "就像下订单",
      "offset": 326366,
      "duration": 1600,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你想要什么",
      "offset": 328400,
      "duration": 1566,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "多少钱什么样的关系",
      "offset": 330166,
      "duration": 3167,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "越清晰越好",
      "offset": 333666,
      "duration": 1700,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "第二步相信",
      "offset": 335433,
      "duration": 2233,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "相信这个目标势在必得",
      "offset": 338200,
      "duration": 2100,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "相信你想要的一切正在发生",
      "offset": 340600,
      "duration": 2566,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "相信宇宙间所有的力量都在响应你",
      "offset": 343600,
      "duration": 3300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "第三步接收",
      "offset": 346900,
      "duration": 2466,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "让自己调整到未来的频率",
      "offset": 349900,
      "duration": 2366,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "让自己处于一种",
      "offset": 352866,
      "duration": 1534,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "和所要求的东西相一致的频率状态",
      "offset": 354400,
      "duration": 3533,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这三步很多书都讲过",
      "offset": 357966,
      "duration": 2634,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "但关键是第四步",
      "offset": 360966,
      "duration": 2034,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "第四步",
      "offset": 363033,
      "duration": 1133,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "释放欲望带来的感受和欲望本身",
      "offset": 364433,
      "duration": 3300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "什么意思",
      "offset": 368500,
      "duration": 1033,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "就是当你下完订单",
      "offset": 370066,
      "duration": 1900,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你要去检查",
      "offset": 371966,
      "duration": 1367,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我对这个目标有什么感觉",
      "offset": 373833,
      "duration": 2333,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是轻松的还是焦虑的",
      "offset": 376366,
      "duration": 2734,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是笃定的还是怀疑的",
      "offset": 379166,
      "duration": 2567,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "有没有我真的配吗这种不配得感",
      "offset": 381766,
      "duration": 3434,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "有没有这能成吗的怀疑",
      "offset": 385500,
      "duration": 2033,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这些负面感受",
      "offset": 387700,
      "duration": 1666,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "就是阻碍吸引力法则生效的障碍",
      "offset": 389500,
      "duration": 2833,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你必须把他们一层一层释放掉",
      "offset": 392766,
      "duration": 2567,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "书里介绍了一个方法",
      "offset": 395400,
      "duration": 1966,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "叫三重欢迎释放法",
      "offset": 397466,
      "duration": 2500,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我用自己的话给你转述一下",
      "offset": 400200,
      "duration": 2466,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "比如你今年的目标是赚100万元",
      "offset": 402666,
      "duration": 3800,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "有了这个目标后",
      "offset": 407066,
      "duration": 1534,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你先体验一下自己",
      "offset": 408700,
      "duration": 1466,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "身体和心理上的感受",
      "offset": 410166,
      "duration": 2067,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你感觉良好",
      "offset": 412233,
      "duration": 1633,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "那很好如果你感觉焦虑",
      "offset": 413866,
      "duration": 3067,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "怀疑紧张",
      "offset": 417033,
      "duration": 1933,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "那你就需要释放",
      "offset": 419266,
      "duration": 1734,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这是第一层",
      "offset": 421433,
      "duration": 1100,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "对目标本身的感受",
      "offset": 422866,
      "duration": 2134,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "然后第二层",
      "offset": 425000,
      "duration": 1266,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是对这些感受的感受",
      "offset": 426666,
      "duration": 2134,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你问自己",
      "offset": 428966,
      "duration": 1367,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我对刚才那种焦虑是什么感觉",
      "offset": 430833,
      "duration": 3033,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是感到无助",
      "offset": 434200,
      "duration": 1466,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "还是觉得自己很可笑",
      "offset": 435833,
      "duration": 2133,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "把这些再释放掉",
      "offset": 438200,
      "duration": 1766,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "第三层",
      "offset": 439966,
      "duration": 1000,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是对感受背后那个我的认同",
      "offset": 441466,
      "duration": 2634,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "问自己当我陷入这些感受的时候",
      "offset": 444766,
      "duration": 3767,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我觉得自己是个什么样的人",
      "offset": 448766,
      "duration": 2367,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是个失败者",
      "offset": 451266,
      "duration": 1434,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是个没能力的人",
      "offset": 452866,
      "duration": 1634,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "把这些标签也释放掉",
      "offset": 454500,
      "duration": 2166,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "一层一层",
      "offset": 456666,
      "duration": 1200,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "直到你内心真正平静下来",
      "offset": 458033,
      "duration": 2767,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "真正处在相信的频率里",
      "offset": 461300,
      "duration": 2366,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "接下来这部分",
      "offset": 464366,
      "duration": 1434,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是我认为这本书最珍贵的地方",
      "offset": 465800,
      "duration": 2666,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "如果吸引力法则不生效",
      "offset": 469033,
      "duration": 2033,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "怎么找原因",
      "offset": 471100,
      "duration": 1300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "怎么解决",
      "offset": 472433,
      "duration": 1133,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "卢奕琳老师在书里提出",
      "offset": 473600,
      "duration": 2200,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "影响吸引力法则生效的有三大力量",
      "offset": 475966,
      "duration": 3300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "正向力量",
      "offset": 479366,
      "duration": 1300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "腹向力量和未知力量",
      "offset": 480766,
      "duration": 2434,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "而负向力量往往来自我们的潜意识",
      "offset": 483866,
      "duration": 3467,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我来给你列举几个最常见的卡点",
      "offset": 487366,
      "duration": 3034,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你可以听听自己有没有中招",
      "offset": 490600,
      "duration": 2266,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "第一个卡点",
      "offset": 493100,
      "duration": 1400,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "不配得感",
      "offset": 494700,
      "duration": 1433,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "嘴上说要赚100万",
      "offset": 496400,
      "duration": 1933,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "心里却觉得我凭啥我这种人也配",
      "offset": 498366,
      "duration": 4100,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这种声音就是你的潜意识在拉手刹",
      "offset": 503033,
      "duration": 3367,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你一边踩油门一边拉手刹",
      "offset": 507233,
      "duration": 2667,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "能量全耗在内耗上",
      "offset": 510266,
      "duration": 2234,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "怎么可能前进",
      "offset": 512566,
      "duration": 1434,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "书里有专门的处理方法",
      "offset": 514100,
      "duration": 2166,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "帮你清理这种没资格和不配得感",
      "offset": 516266,
      "duration": 3267,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "第二个卡点",
      "offset": 519633,
      "duration": 1367,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "原生家庭的限制性信念",
      "offset": 521433,
      "duration": 2267,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你有没有发现",
      "offset": 523766,
      "duration": 1700,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们对金钱",
      "offset": 525666,
      "duration": 1600,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "对关系的很多看法",
      "offset": 527266,
      "duration": 2067,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "其实是从父母那里继承来的",
      "offset": 529466,
      "duration": 2634,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "父母从小告诉你钱难赚",
      "offset": 532200,
      "duration": 2700,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "屎难吃咱们家没那个命",
      "offset": 534900,
      "duration": 2700,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你表面上不信",
      "offset": 537766,
      "duration": 1534,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "但潜意识里早",
      "offset": 539300,
      "duration": 1166,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "就信了",
      "offset": 540466,
      "duration": 1100,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这种家庭系统中传递下来的匮",
      "offset": 541766,
      "duration": 2467,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "乏动力也会制约你",
      "offset": 544233,
      "duration": 2333,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "第三个卡点",
      "offset": 546600,
      "duration": 1566,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "能量被卸掉了",
      "offset": 548500,
      "duration": 1733,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这个特别现实",
      "offset": 550233,
      "duration": 1533,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你每天刷短视频两小时",
      "offset": 551800,
      "duration": 2533,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "看各种焦虑的新闻",
      "offset": 554700,
      "duration": 1666,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "和负面的人聊天",
      "offset": 556700,
      "duration": 1766,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你的能量早就被卸光了",
      "offset": 558766,
      "duration": 2334,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "哪还有余力去吸引什么好事",
      "offset": 561100,
      "duration": 2400,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "书里专门有一节",
      "offset": 563500,
      "duration": 1166,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "讲什么会破坏吸引力法则",
      "offset": 564666,
      "duration": 2700,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒你注意这些日常的消耗",
      "offset": 567600,
      "duration": 2466,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这些卡点不解决",
      "offset": 570866,
      "duration": 1634,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你下再多订单都没用",
      "offset": 572800,
      "duration": 2300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "就像种花",
      "offset": 575100,
      "duration": 1433,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你光在上面浇水",
      "offset": 576666,
      "duration": 1900,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "但土里有虫子",
      "offset": 578966,
      "duration": 1434,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "有病毒根都烂了",
      "offset": 580400,
      "duration": 2566,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "花怎么可能开",
      "offset": 583000,
      "duration": 1466,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "除了理论和方法",
      "offset": 584466,
      "duration": 1934,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这本书还给了很多",
      "offset": 586466,
      "duration": 1534,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "可以直接上手练的功课",
      "offset": 588000,
      "duration": 2133,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "比如每天写3条感恩日记",
      "offset": 590400,
      "duration": 3166,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "感恩今天吃到的美食",
      "offset": 593833,
      "duration": 2233,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "感恩路上遇见的微笑",
      "offset": 596200,
      "duration": 2133,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "感恩外卖没撒",
      "offset": 598633,
      "duration": 1433,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "书里说感恩是最高频的能量",
      "offset": 600266,
      "duration": 3467,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "当你开始感恩",
      "offset": 603866,
      "duration": 1334,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你就处在了拥有的状态",
      "offset": 605500,
      "duration": 2400,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "而不是缺乏的状态",
      "offset": 607900,
      "duration": 2000,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "比如睡前造梦5分钟",
      "offset": 610666,
      "duration": 3200,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "闭上眼睛",
      "offset": 613866,
      "duration": 1434,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "想象你已经过上了理想的生活",
      "offset": 615600,
      "duration": 2733,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你住在什么样的房子里",
      "offset": 618666,
      "duration": 2034,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "房间里是什么味道",
      "offset": 620800,
      "duration": 1800,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你穿着什么样的衣服",
      "offset": 622833,
      "duration": 1733,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "和谁在一起",
      "offset": 624766,
      "duration": 1500,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "大脑分不清想象和现实",
      "offset": 626266,
      "duration": 2334,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你骗久了",
      "offset": 628966,
      "duration": 1400,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "他就真的帮你实现",
      "offset": 630466,
      "duration": 1867,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "还有专门针对财富的冥想练习",
      "offset": 632900,
      "duration": 2600,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "名字就叫我爱金钱",
      "offset": 635766,
      "duration": 2334,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "金钱爱我",
      "offset": 638100,
      "duration": 1400,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "录这段的时候",
      "offset": 639500,
      "duration": 1666,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "我自己都被暖到了",
      "offset": 641166,
      "duration": 1700,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "那种和金钱建立友善关系的感觉",
      "offset": 643466,
      "duration": 3100,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "真的很奇妙",
      "offset": 646666,
      "duration": 1334,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "书里还有一个部分",
      "offset": 648366,
      "duration": 1434,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "专门讲吸引亲密关系",
      "offset": 649800,
      "duration": 2500,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "卢奕琳老师说",
      "offset": 652366,
      "duration": 1567,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "很多人找不到理想的伴侣",
      "offset": 654100,
      "duration": 2266,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是因为心里有一个假想敌",
      "offset": 656700,
      "duration": 2100,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "要么觉得异性都不靠谱",
      "offset": 659400,
      "duration": 2100,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "要么觉得好男人美",
      "offset": 661766,
      "duration": 1234,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "好女人都被抢光了",
      "offset": 663000,
      "duration": 1933,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "这种预设",
      "offset": 664966,
      "duration": 1234,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "本身就是最大的障碍",
      "offset": 666466,
      "duration": 1934,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "录完整本书我最大",
      "offset": 669300,
      "duration": 1866,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "的感受是",
      "offset": 671166,
      "duration": 1400,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "吸引力法则不是许愿池",
      "offset": 672800,
      "duration": 2300,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "而是一场成为的游戏",
      "offset": 675366,
      "duration": 2200,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "张德芬老师为这本书作序",
      "offset": 677566,
      "duration": 2434,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "他说了一句话我特别喜欢",
      "offset": 680166,
      "duration": 3000,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你不可能经由一个没有喜悦的过程",
      "offset": 683233,
      "duration": 2900,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "到达一个喜悦的终点",
      "offset": 686300,
      "duration": 1966,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "就有的人格模式和信念",
      "offset": 688833,
      "duration": 2067,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "是实现心想事成的重要阻碍",
      "offset": 691033,
      "duration": 2633,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "当你从我要变成我就是",
      "offset": 693800,
      "duration": 2600,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "从向外抓取变成向内调整",
      "offset": 696866,
      "duration": 2800,
      "lang": "zh"
    },
    {
      "text": "你会发现",
      "offset": 700033,
      "duration": 1433,
      "lang": "zh"
